518: # path (ordinal), LF-joined with a trailing LF. The path is part of every line, so a
519: # rename changes the value even when the content does not. <mode> comes from
520: # Get-GitModeMap for tracked entries ('=' when git diff HEAD does not list the path,
521: # i.e. the worktree matches HEAD there); untracked entries get 'u' (mode not
522: # recorded). Entries under the
